# pricing citations. SPAWNING RULE evidence: this branch's
# hooks/spawn-guard.mjs and scripts/lib/model-mismatch.mjs, and a live
# audit probe on this machine (2026-09-23) that found 17 real
# stale-generation spawns from sessions on Claude Code 2.1.275, below the
# 2.1.280 alias-resolution floor. Cache-TTL evidence: a 30-day measurement
# over 1,407 subagent transcripts, 2026-09-23,
# ~/.claude/reports/2026-09-23-subagent-cache-ttl.md (operator-local; not
